(7219781, 1112751, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool idea--a few things in my opinion might have made it stronger:  there''s clutter in the background that subtracts from your shot, and the brightness and white balance on your miniature person doesn''t match its surroundings.  The shadows are pretty good, especially against the camera.  Neat brownie camera BTW!</td>', 'This is a very cool idea--a few things in my opinion might have made it stronger:  there''s clutter in the background that subtracts from your shot, and the brightness and white balance on your miniature person doesn''t match its surroundings.  The shadows are pretty good, especially against the camera.  Neat brownie camera BTW!', '2014-05-22 22:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219782, 1112854, 128323, '<td valign="top">The bluish light reminds me of a fridge door that''s open lighting this.  This would be cool if you had cream in the other hand :)</td>', 'The bluish light reminds me of a fridge door that''s open lighting this.  This would be cool if you had cream in the other hand :)', '2014-05-22 22:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
