(7220873, 1113041, 124982, '<td valign="top">I think you had a decent concept, but technically you struggled with the execution. Great job masking the birds, but the sky looks completely unnatural and the image overall is oversharpened and over-contrasted!</td>', 'I think you had a decent concept, but technically you struggled with the execution. Great job masking the birds, but the sky looks completely unnatural and the image overall is oversharpened and over-contrasted!', '2014-05-26 10:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220875, 1113221, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Like the idea. Not quite sold on the pixelated body and background though. Still great idea with the face panels.</td>', 'Nicely done! Like the idea. Not quite sold on the pixelated body and background though. Still great idea with the face panels.', '2014-05-26 10:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220877, 1113295, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, Jeff. Strong showing in self-portraits as always!! Processing seems a little heavy-handed on this one though, and not as smooth as you normally do. Note the neck..the skin looks completely overcooked. Still expect to see this on the front page though!</td>', 'Nicely done, Jeff. Strong showing in self-portraits as always!! Processing seems a little heavy-handed on this one though, and not as smooth as you normally do. Note the neck..the skin looks completely overcooked. Still expect to see this on the front page though!', '2014-05-26 10:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220878, 1113121, 124982, '<td valign="top">She does have piercing blue eyes!! Wish they were a little more in focus though!</td>', 'She does have piercing blue eyes!! Wish they were a little more in focus though!', '2014-05-26 10:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220881, 1113145, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really great self-portrait, Robt! Relaxed, unforced and genuine! Should do well!<br/> <br/>A little safe though, perhaps?</td>', 'Really great self-portrait, Robt! Relaxed, unforced and genuine! Should do well! A little safe though, perhaps?', '2014-05-26 10:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220882, 1113203, 124982, '<td valign="top">Bizarro, my friend!</td>', 'Bizarro, my friend!', '2014-05-26 10:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220883, 1112802, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! really like the processing -- tones and overlays are lovely!</td>', 'Nicely done! really like the processing -- tones and overlays are lovely!', '2014-05-26 10:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220884, 1113303, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice job, Sam! Love the composition and lighting! Not your best editing/processing though -- hands grabbing the stem don''t look particularly natural. The pissed off expression also doesn''t quite fit for me. Still, a top 5 submission and likely ribbon winner.</td>', 'Nice job, Sam! Love the composition and lighting! Not your best editing/processing though -- hands grabbing the stem don''t look particularly natural. The pissed off expression also doesn''t quite fit for me. Still, a top 5 submission and likely ribbon winner.', '2014-05-26 10:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220885, 1113262, 124982, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but I just don''t get the connection between the title and the image. I''m looking for it, but can''t quite get the dots to join. Also would like to see the processing around the bottom of the suit/water interface a little smoother, appears to jagged and unnatural.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but I just don''t get the connection between the title and the image. I''m looking for it, but can''t quite get the dots to join. Also would like to see the processing around the bottom of the suit/water interface a little smoother, appears to jagged and unnatural.', '2014-05-26 10:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220886, 1113290, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but why oh why did you keep the icky green/grey painted wall behind you? Looks like a mug shot right now ... if you replaced the background with a sky or some other background (easy to do), it would''ve popped so much more.</td>', 'Nice concept, but why oh why did you keep the icky green/grey painted wall behind you? Looks like a mug shot right now ... if you replaced the background with a sky or some other background (easy to do), it would''ve popped so much more.', '2014-05-26 10:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
