(7221443, 1113145, 75713, '<td valign="top"><br/>I look  at this avatar and try to embed it in my mind of the many I have seen in past .. and it''s from one end of the spectrum to the other ... your other shots, while brilliant in their own way, rather scared me from asking questions or initiating a conversation - in this rendition I would have no problem approaching you. <br/> <br/>But now you''re in deep doodoo ... many of the lesser known members will approach you with questions asking for advice and insight .. but you brought in on yourself by letting us ''see'' the real man behind the name :)</td>', 'I look  at this avatar and try to embed it in my mind of the many I have seen in past .. and it''s from one end of the spectrum to the other ... your other shots, while brilliant in their own way, rather scared me from asking questions or initiating a conversation - in this rendition I would have no problem approaching you.  But now you''re in deep doodoo ... many of the lesser known members will approach you with questions asking for advice and insight .. but you brought in on yourself by letting us ''see'' the real man behind the name :)', '2014-05-28 02:25:46.000000', NULL, 0),
